                                        <p class="txt-size-20 title">Student Honored by Somerset County for Her Efforts in Government, Social Service</p>
                                        <p class="txt-size-16">Raritan Valley Community College student Manuela Bulgaro of Manville earned the honor for her work organizing civic education initiatives, voter registration drives, and community-based projects.</p>
