                                <h3 class="txt-size-20 news-title"><a href="https://www.raritanval.edu/news/planetarium-to-present-holiday-shows-in-december/">Planetarium to Present Holiday Shows in December</a></h3>
                                                                    <p class="txt-size-16 excerpt">
                                        The Raritan Valley Community College Planetarium will illuminate the skies in December with holiday star shows and laser concerts for all ages.                                     </p>
                                                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                                            <div class="swiper-slide single-news-slide">
                            <div class="image-wrap">
                                                                    <picture><source sizes='(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px' type="image/webp" data-srcset="https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-1024x682.jpg.webp 1024w, https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-300x200.jpg.webp 300w, https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-768x512.jpg.webp 768w, https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet.jpg.webp 1264w"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="682" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image lazyload" alt="nutcracker ballet dancers" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-eio="p" data-src="https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-1024x682.jpg" data-srcset="https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet.jpg 1264w" data-max-width="1024" data-sizes="auto" data-eio-rwidth="1024" data-eio-rheight="682" /></picture><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="682" src="https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-1024x682.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" alt="nutcracker ballet dancers" srcset="https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nutcracker-Magical-Christmas-Ballet-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.raritanval.edu/wp-co