                                <h3 class="txt-size-20 news-title"><a href="https://www.raritanval.edu/news/rvcc-theatre-to-present-nutcracker-ballet-a-holiday-tradition/">RVCC Theatre to Present ‘Nutcracker’ Ballet, a Holiday Tradition</a></h3>
                                                                    <p class="txt-size-16 excerpt">
                                        Celebrate the season with a holiday tradition—a performance of Nutcracker! Magical Christmas Ballet—Friday, December 4, with stagings at 4 p.m. and 8 p.m., at The Theatre at Raritan Valley Community College.                                    </p>
                                                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
