                                <h3 class="txt-size-20 news-title"><a href="https://www.raritanval.edu/news/hyundai-donates-vehicle-to-rvcc-automotive-program/">Hyundai Donates Vehicle to RVCC Automotive Program</a></h3>
                                                                    <p class="txt-size-16 excerpt">
                                        Hyundai Motor America has donated a 2025 Hyundai Elantra N to Raritan Valley Community College’s Automotive Technology program to help students gain real-world experience in the automotive industry.                                    </p>
                                                                
                            </div>
