                                <h3 class="txt-size-20 news-title"><a href="https://www.raritanval.edu/news/23rd-annual-juried-exhibition-to-feature-artwork-by-rvcc-students/">23rd Annual Juried Exhibition to Feature Artwork by RVCC Students</a></h3>
                                                                    <p class="txt-size-16 excerpt">
                                        The Arts &#038; Design department will present the 23rd Annual RVCC Juried Student Art Exhibition, November 13-December 3, in the Art Gallery.                                    </p>
                                                                
